@startuml
title Vision Component Diagram
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Agent/Core" as Agent
actor "Operator" as User

package "Vision Service" {
  [FastAPI API\nsrc/api.py] as API
  [Capture Layer\nsrc/capture/webcam_capture.py] as Capture
  [Preprocessing\nsrc/preprocessing/preprocess.py] as Preprocess
  [Semantic Vision Pipeline\nsrc/vision/pipeline.py] as Pipeline
  [Gemini VLM\nsrc/vision/vlm/gemini_vlm.py] as Gemini
  [Validation\nschema + coordinates] as Validation
  [Debug Overlay\nsrc/vision/debug/overlay_generator.py] as Overlay
  [Session Storage\nvision/data/sessions/] as Storage
  [Optional OCR\npytesseract / EasyOCR / PaddleOCR] as OCR
  [Optional YOLO Fast-Path\nultralytics] as YOLO
}

cloud "Google Gemini API" as GeminiAPI
database "Session Artifacts" as Sessions

User --> API : HTTP requests
Agent --> API : /vision/* endpoints

API --> Capture : start / stop / stream
API --> Preprocess : preprocess_all()
API --> Pipeline : single-shot processing
API --> Storage : write frames / JSON / overlays

Capture --> Storage : raw frames
Preprocess --> Storage : preprocessed frames
Pipeline --> Gemini : analyze()
Pipeline --> Validation : validate schema / coordinates
Pipeline --> Overlay : generate debug overlay
Pipeline --> Storage : final JSON + debug image

Gemini --> GeminiAPI : generate_content()
Validation --> Storage : cleaned output
OCR ..> Pipeline : enrichment support
YOLO ..> Pipeline : optional fast-path / legacy support

Sessions <-- Storage

note right of Pipeline
Main live path is Gemini semantic analysis.
Validation keeps only coordinate-safe detections.
end note

@enduml
